6. Modifying Elements in the DOM

JavaScript allows us to modify elements dynamically.

(a) Changing Inner Text (innerText)

document.getElementById("myTitle").innerText = "New Title";

(b) Changing Inner HTML (innerHTML)

document.getElementById("myDiv").innerHTML = "<p>New Content</p>";

(c) Changing Attributes (setAttribute())

